        },
        {
          "text": "Ikangure, ikangure, vyuka uve hasi, ewe Yerusalemu, uwo Uhoraho yasomesheje ku gikombe c’uburake bgiwe; wanyoye ku gakarabo ari ko gikombe c’ukudandabagiranya, uracīrāngūza. ",
