              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bawe bararavye, bahindikiranye ku mayirabiri hose, nk’impongo iguye mu mutego; bamazwe n’uburake bg’Uhoraho, ni kwo guhana kw’ Imana yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
